the tests, were they all right?"}, {"start": 29.226, "end": 30.767, "text": "I have been worrying about them all week."}, {"start": 31.687, "end": 32.228, "text": "They were."}, {"start": 32.728, "end": 36.87, "text": "Your long-term sugar value is 43 millimoles per mole."}, {"start": 37.831, "end": 38.691, "text": "Is that a good number?"}, {"start": 39.452, "end": 40.292, "text": "It sounds high to me."}, {"start": 41.413, "end": 42.293, "text": "It is a good number."}, {"start": 42.593, "end": 44.494, "text": "Your diabetes is well controlled."}, {"start": 45.395, "end": 46.055, "text": "Well controlled."}, {"start": 46.876, "end": 47.816, "text": "You are sure about that?"}, {"start": 48.757, "end": 49.197, "text": "I am."}, {"start": 49.617, "end": 51.058, "text": "That is what the result shows."}, {"start": 52.199, "end": 52.859, "text": "And my kidneys?"}, {"start": 53.74, "end": 55.441, "text": "That is the part that frightens me most."}, {"start": 56.481, "end": 58.062, "text": "Your creatinine is normal."}, {"start": 58.302, "end": 60.344, "text": "And there is no albumin in your urine."}, {"start": 61.244, "end": 62.345, "text": "So nothing showing there?"}, {"start": 63.286, "end": 65.168, "text": "Nothing showing on those tests, no."}, {"start": 66.689, "end": 67.95, "text": "Alright, that does help."}, {"start": 68.951, "end": 70.692, "text": "Good, so nothing changes."}, {"start": 71.112, "end": 74.115, "text": "Continue your current treatment exactly as it is."}, {"start": 75.236, "end": 76.697, "text": "And I do not need anything extra?"}, {"start": 77.257, "end": 77.958, "text": "No new medicine?"}, {"start": 78.959, "end": 80.98, "text": "No, routine follow-up as usual."}, {"start": 81.781, "end": 82.842, "text": "Routine, yes."}, {"start": 83.602, "end": 84.543, "text": "I can manage routine."}, {"start": 85.544, "end": 86.084, "text": "You can."}, {"start": 86.385, "end": 87.986, "text": "Did you finish that book you mentioned?"}, {"start": 89.022, "end": 89.743, "text": "I did, actually."}, {"start": 90.424, "end": 92.046, "text": "The ending was better than I expected."}, {"start": 93.127, "end": 93.748, "text": "Good to hear."}, {"start": 94.709, "end": 96.991, "text": "It kept me occupied while I was waiting for all of this."}, {"start": 98.193, "end": 99.534, "text": "Then it earned its place."}, {"start": 100.055, "end": 101.236, "text": "That is everything, Signa."}, {"start": 101.457, "end": 102.017, "text": "Take care."}, {"start": 102.978, "end": 103.639, "text": "Thank you, Doctor."}, {"start": 103.659, "end": 103.899, "text": "Goodbye."}, {"start": 103.919, "end": 104.28, "text": "Goodbye."}], "machine": "gpu59.int.triton.aalto.fi", "git_commit": "735eed3a1a4f5d8bc8a3ac1f1c8897e291443b9f", "date": "2026-09-20", "timing_s": {"transcribe_and_align": 1.969}}